{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__omdsh-runtime#feature-pack","repo":"omdsh-dev/omdsh-runtime","commit":"816d453c1d20afa110b78f4cc524d7a58c45679a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OMDSH Runtime 的 Profile Pack 功能：创建、导出、锁定和签名含固定插件来源的配置包。通过 omdsh pack 命令操作清单或当前 Profile，产出可检查和分发的包文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/cli.mjs:15-42","dist/profile-pack.mjs:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__omdsh-runtime#feature-apply","repo":"omdsh-dev/omdsh-runtime","commit":"816d453c1d20afa110b78f4cc524d7a58c45679a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OMDSH Runtime 的候选应用功能：先规划并暂存 Pack 变更，再通过独立的 activate 和 confirm 命令确认运行。用户提供 Pack 文件与 Profile 选项，Runtime 准备候选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/cli.mjs:15-42","dist/manager.mjs:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__omdsh-runtime#feature-rollback","repo":"omdsh-dev/omdsh-runtime","commit":"816d453c1d20afa110b78f4cc524d7a58c45679a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OMDSH Runtime 的恢复功能：检查命名实例、更新实例或回滚到先前的 Profile 代次。通过 pack update、pack rollback 或 recover 命令操作，恢复 Profile 选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/cli.mjs:15-42","dist/manager.mjs:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__omdsh-runtime#feature-licenses","repo":"omdsh-dev/omdsh-runtime","commit":"816d453c1d20afa110b78f4cc524d7a58c45679a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OMDSH Runtime 的许可证清单功能：为 Pack 中的组件汇总 SPDX 表达式、来源和需要人工审阅的提示。使用 pack licenses 命令并提供清单或 Pack 文件，输出组件许可证事实。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/cli.mjs:15-42","dist/profile-pack.mjs:1-30"]}
